flowchart TD
  Q[Claim due investigation] --> L[Call AbuseIPDB]
  L --> OK{Valid response?}
  OK -- Yes --> C[Persist evidence + completed]
  OK -- No --> E{Transient failure?}
  E -- No --> F[Persist failed and safe error]
  E -- Yes --> M{Attempts remaining?}
  M -- No --> F
  M -- Yes --> R[Set queued + next_attempt_at]
  R --> Q
